<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CSR in sugar merger talks - paper.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CSR in sugar merger talks - paper.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sugar producer and building materials group CSR Ltd has held preliminary merger talks with sugar rivals Mackay Refined Sugars and Manildra Harwood, The Sydney Morning Herald newspaper reported on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;All the players are walking around the dance floor,&quot; one of the players was quoted as saying by the Herald.</p>
<p>All three have about 90 percent of the Australasian white sugar market, the newspaper said, adding taht any merger would be closely monitored by the anti-monopolies watchdog, the Australian Competition and Consumer Commission.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
